      <p>We strive to provide accurate tools; however, <strong>results are not guaranteed to meet any specific exam's, application's, or institution's official size rules or dimension requirements.</strong> You are solely responsible for ensuring your final file meets the criteria of the system you are uploading it to.</p>

      <h3>Limitation of Liability</h3>
      <p>We shall not be held liable for any damages, errors, or missed deadlines arising from the use of our service.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
